==Finnish==

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# {{lb|fi|obsolete}} [[side]], [[flank]]

====Usage notes====
The noun sense has practically ceased to exist in modern Finnish. Some cases are used as adverbs, and the lemma '''''ohi''''' has become a preposition and postposition (see corresponding sections below). It's also used as prefix or modifier in compound terms.

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-ovi|oh|||a}}
* Prolative: {{l|fi|ohitse}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fi|kuve}}
* {{l|fi|kylki}}
* {{l|fi|pieli}}
* {{l|fi|sivu}}
* {{l|fi|vieri}}
* {{l|fi|vierusta}}

===Adverb===
{{fi-adv}}

# {{lb|fi|spatial}} used to indicate movement past or beyond a certain point
#: ''Minun piti kääntyä toisesta risteyksestä oikealle, mutta ajoinkin '''ohi'''.'' (llit. "drove past")
#:: I was supposed to turn right from the second intersection but I missed it.
# {{lb|fi|temporal}} [[over]]
#: Se on '''ohi''' nyt.
#:: It is ''over'' now.

====Usage notes====
* The inflected forms shown in the table are used as adverbs, postpositions and prepositions, see appropriate entries.

====Inflection====
{{fi-decl-pron|1s=[[ohi]]|5s=[[ohessa]]|6s=[[ohesta]]|7s=[[oheen]]|8s=[[ohella]]|9s=[[ohelta]]|10s=[[ohelle]]|a4s=[[ohi]]|a10s=[[ohi]]<br/>[[ohitse]]}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fi|ohitse}}

===Postposition===
([[genitive]] +) {{fi-postp}}

# {{lb|fi|spatial}} [[by]], [[past]] (when one goes ''through'' the space that is ''next to'' something):
#: Pallo pyöri tuolin '''ohi''' ja ovesta ulos.
#:: The ball rolled ''by'' the chair and out of the door.
#: ''Pallo pyöri minun '''ohitseni'''.''
#:: The ball rolled '''past''' me.
# {{lb|fi|spatial}} [[wide]]
#: ''Nuoli meni maalin '''ohi'''.''
#:: The arrow fell ''wide'' of the mark.

====Usage notes====
* Only the inflected forms of '''''ohi''''' may assume a [[possessive suffix]]. Thus instead of ''"ohi" + possessive suffix'' one must use '"ohitse" + possessive suffix'', as in one of the examples above.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fi|ohitse}}

===Preposition===
{{head|fi|preposition|+ [[elative]]}}

# (''spatial'') [[past]]
#: ''Olimme jo '''ohi''' sillasta, kun onnettomuus tapahtui.''
#:: We were already ''past'' the bridge, when the accident took place.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fi|ohitse}}

